---
/*
 * The whole product in one picture: a request in the source repository, the document in the
 * middle, a request on the receiving side. The lines are the real tool names and the
 * real steps, abbreviated.
 */
---

<figure class="flow" aria-label="A backend agent writes and exports a HANDOFF.md; a mobile agent reads the file and plans the work.">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="repo">backend</span>
      <span class="agent">Claude Code</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lines">
      <p class="prompt"><span class="caret">›</span> write a handoff for the mobile team</p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> <span class="tool">handoff_context</span> <span class="dim">14 files · 2 breaking</span></p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> <span class="tool">handoff_source</span> <span class="dim">auth/refresh.ts</span></p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> <span class="tool">handoff_write</span> <span class="dim">HANDOFF.md</span></p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> reviewed Required Actions</p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> <span class="tool">handoff_export</span> <span class="dim">exports/auth-refresh.md</span></p>
      <p class="ask"><span class="q">→</span> Complete Markdown file exported</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 16" width="40" height="16"><path d="M1 8h36m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </div>

  <div class="doc">
    <div class="doc-head">
      <span>HANDOFF.md</span>
      <span class="badge">breaking</span>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-body">
      <p class="fm">targets: [mobile, web]</p>
      <p class="fm">change_type: [api, authentication]</p>
      <p class="h1">Refresh tokens are now single-use</p>
      <p class="h2">Required Actions · mobile</p>
      <p class="li"><span class="n">1.</span>Persist the new <code>refreshToken</code>.</p>
      <p class="li"><span class="n">2.</span>Replace both tokens in one write.</p>
      <p class="h2">Instructions for Receiving Agent</p>
      <p class="li muted">Modify the existing refresh path. No second token store.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 16" width="40" height="16"><path d="M1 8h36m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="repo">mobile</span>
      <span class="agent">Codex</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lines">
      <p class="prompt"><span class="caret">›</span> receive this handoff</p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> <span class="tool">handoff_receive</span> <span class="dim">narrowed to mobile</span></p>
      <p><span class="ok">✓</span> searched this repo <span class="dim">3 matches</span></p>
      <p class="finding"><span class="warn">!</span> <code>AuthRepository.refresh()</code> keeps the old token</p>
      <p class="ask"><span class="q">→</span> Plan: 2 changes, 1 test. Implement?</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.05fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .panel,
  .doc {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .panel-head,
  .doc-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-sunken);
    font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--font-mono);
  }

  .repo {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .agent {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .lines {
    padding: 14px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
    font: 12.5px/1.5 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .lines p {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--fg);
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
  }

  .caret,
  .q {
    color: var(--accent-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ok {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .warn {
    color: var(--warn);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .tool {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .dim {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .lines code,
  .doc code {
    font-size: 1em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .ask {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .doc {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 45%, var(--border));
  }

  .doc-head {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .badge {
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--warn-soft);
    color: var(--warn);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .doc-body {
    padding: 14px 16px 16px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fm {
    font: 12px/1.5 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .h1 {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .h2 {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font: 600 11px/1.4 var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .li {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .li .n {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 1.4em;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .arrow {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
